# Net / uplink / OTA

- Soft-AP APIs (`/api/status`, `/api/catalog`, `/api/read`, `/api/write`, `/api/control`) stay honest about readiness.
- Uplink: `doc/guide/uplink.md` (batched, encrypted). No plaintext credential logging.
- OTA: `doc/guide/ota.md`; no brick paths without documented recovery.
- Bound batch size/rate; separate link errors from stale samples in status JSON.
- Hostname/SSID identity: `doc/product/network-identity-implementation-notes.md`.
